      "raw": "<p>If you think Visionary is the weakest hero, you should try to play her some more. &nbsp; I think she&#39;s one of the strongest. &nbsp;Of course you can play how you want, but the nerf to wrest the mind was very much needed and balances her nicely. &nbsp;<em>Suggestion &nbsp;</em>in particular is profoundly strong. &nbsp;<em>Mental Divergence&nbsp;</em>is also an amazing card, whose only real drawback is that you can&#39;t really use it and <em>Enlighten</em> at the same time (without aid from another hero of course). &nbsp; <em>Enlighten</em> is one of the best support powers in the base game, second to <em>Galvanize</em> and that&#39;s all. &nbsp;And of course, <em>Wrest the Mind&nbsp;</em>is very strong, slap it on a powerful card, electroupulse explosive, Voss&#39; dreadnaughts, T-rexes, Krakens, &nbsp;whatever. &nbsp;</p>",
