      "raw": "[quote=\"bandbc\"]\n\nIn my opinon, we will not play by this Errata. The Visionary is the weakest of the Heros in the first place, and this is the one card that balences her out in play. I think you need to leave this one alone. Just my opinon.\n\n[/quote]\n\nErrata-free Wrest the Mind supercombo:\n\n1. Visionary plays Wrest the Mind on herself.\n\n2. Any damage she deals to herself is redirected.\n\n3.&nbsp; When she deals damage, she deals two more damage and then two to herself (which is redirected and causes her to deal even more damage).\n\n&nbsp;\n\nThis is broken.&nbsp; Without the errata this is pretty much an auto-win.&nbsp; My group thought The Visionary wasn&#39;t very good at first.&nbsp; Then we played Wrest the Mind (with errata) on an Electro-Pulse Explosive and utterly destroyed it and Omnitron.&nbsp; If I were you, I would play with the errata before arguing whether it throws her out of balance or not.\n",
