      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"bandbc\"]\n\nIn my opinon, we will not play by this Errata. The Visionary is the weakest of the Heros in the first place, and this is the one card that balences her out in play. I think you need to leave this one alone. Just my opinon.\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nWelcome to the forums!\n\nAre you looking for ideas about how to make effective use of Visionary?\n",
